er? Are you ready to lift more than just weights?\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of the Powerhouse Weightlifting logo.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Join Powerhouse Weightlifting today. Unleash your strength.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black with text displaying \\\"Call us at (phone number) or visit www.powerhouseweightlifting.com to sign up now.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Sign up now and get your first class free. Powerhouse Weightlifting \\u2013 where strength meets community.\\\"\\n\\n[End with upbeat music fading out.]\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 431}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720824594, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kJNKScA9m4srrlof3LIkzh7511GT\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[Open with the sound of a golf club striking a ball]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"The perfect drive... the perfect putt... the perfect round. It all starts with the perfect golf club.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to beautiful aerial shots of a lush green golf course]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Welcome to The Green Haven Golf Club. More than just a golf course, it's a golfer's paradise.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a golfer lining up his shot]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Our meticulously designed 18-hole course challenges both the amateur and the seasoned pro.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to scene of golfer taking a shot]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"With fairways that demand accuracy, and greens that demand precision.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a person enjoying a drink at the clubhouse]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"At Green Haven, it's not just about the game. It's about the experience. Our clubhouse offers first-class facilities, with a relaxing lounge and a fine-dining restaurant.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to scenes of a pro shop with a staff member advising a customer]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Our pro shop stocks the latest golfing gear and our PGA certified professionals are always on hand to provide expert advice and lessons.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut t