ctively. They\\u2019ll guide you every step of the way, helping you progress at your own pace.\\\"\\n\\n[Visuals of trainers helping students, giving thumbs-up, and smiling]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're a beginner or an advanced lifter, PowerPlus accommodates all levels.\\\"\\n\\n[Visuals of a diverse group of people lifting weights]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"What are you waiting for? Take the first step towards a stronger, healthier, and more confident you.\\u201d\\n\\n[Visuals of a busy weightlifting class, people looking satisfied and determined]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Join PowerPlus Weightlifting Class today. Unleash your power.\\\"\\n\\n[Visuals of the PowerPlus logo, contact details and a call-to-action button]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"PowerPlus - Where Strength Meets Confidence.\\u201d\\n\\n[End with upbeat music and fade out]\\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 402}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720825168, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kJWaKp9XtUGWTAWSUrnMOfnrzUBb\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A beautifully manicured lush green golf course under a clear blue sky.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome to the world of luxury, where the greens are endless, and the sky is the limit.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of a golfer's hand gripping a high-quality golf club.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome to Fairway Golf Club.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a golfer swinging the club and hitting the ball. The ball soars across the serene blue sky.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"An experience like no other, where precision meets passion, and where skill is only the beginning.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a golfer lining up a putt on the pristine green. He strikes the ball, and it rolls smoothly into the hole.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Fairway Golf Club \\u2013 the destination for golfers who demand the best.\