he contact information appears)\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Reserve your spot today. Visit our website or call us at the number on your screen. Power Lift - transform yourself!\\\"\\n\\n(Ad ends with energetic music fading out)\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 396}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720825681, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kJerfcEdurPMYbGQF1oCwGTiogV7\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A gleaming sunrise with a beautiful green golf course]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Welcome to the most exciting journey in golf...\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a drone-shot, sweeping across the perfect fairways of the golf course]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"...where luxury meets passion, where precision meets freedom.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of a golf club hitting a ball]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Welcome to Fairway Estates Golf Club, where every swing matters.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to various shots of golfers in action, beautiful views, and club amenities]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Nestled in the heart of nature's bounty, Fairway Estates Golf Club is more than just a golf course \\u2013 it's an experience.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the clubhouse shot showing people socializing, relaxing, and dining]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Our world-class facilities extend beyond the course. Enjoy fine dining, relax in our spa, or socialize in our exclusive club house.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of golf carts parked neatly]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"We offer top-of-the-line equipment and golf carts to make your game as enjoyable as possible.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a golfer taking a swing]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Whether you're a seasoned golfer or a newcomer to the sport, our PGA-certified instructors are here to help you improve your game.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the greens]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Our meticulously manicured greens offer a challenge to players of all levels.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a panoramic view of the golf course