nsition to: A series of shots showing people of different ages, genders, and ethnicities]\\n\\nVO: Therapy is for everyone. There's no shame in seeking help. In fact, it's one of the bravest things you can do.\\n\\n[Cut to: The same people from before, now looking happier and more content]\\n\\nVO: So, no matter what you're going through, remember: it's okay to ask for help. It's okay to prioritize your mental health.\\n\\n[Cut to: Company logo]\\n\\nVO: At [Company Name], we connect you with professional therapists who are ready to help you on your journey towards better mental health.\\n\\n[Closing shot: The logo fades out, replaced by the company website and contact information]\\n\\nVO: Visit our website or call us today. Let\\u2019s start your healing journey together. \\n\\n[End of Advert]\\n\\nVO: [Company Name]. Because everyone deserves a chance to heal.\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 432}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720825714, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kJfOuSF2FF37TJYduziU4kQMLBGZ\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[Scene: An idyllic countryside. Sunlight dances on a field of golden barley. The sounds of nature create a serene ambience.]\\n\\nVoiceover (VO): \\\"From the heart of nature...where the sun meets the earth...comes a symphony of flavors.\\\"\\n\\n[Camera cuts to a close-up shot of a burbling stream. The water is crystal clear, reflecting the azure sky.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Sourced from the purest waters...handpicked barley kissed by the morning sun...our beer is more than just a drink.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A traditional brewery with workers passionately crafting beer. Wooden barrels, gleaming copper brewing kettles, and a master brewer overseeing the process.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"At [Brand Name], we believe in brewing not just beer, but experiences. The secret to our rich, full-bodied taste lies in our time-honored brewing process...\\\"\\n\\n[Camera cuts to a close up of the beer bein