ertisement.\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 433}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720826614, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kJtudOsm4cSIvxQXmB4Egt77jgVx\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a social network\", \"response\": \"[Soft background music starts. The screen shows a group of young people, sharing a laugh in a caf\\u00e9, their smartphones in their hands.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"In a world where connections are everything...\\\"\\n\\n[The scene transitions to a woman alone in her room, smiling at her computer screen.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Where your voice can reach millions with a single post...\\\"\\n\\n[Scene changes to a bustling city street where individuals are seen using their smartphones.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And where every moment shared creates bonds stronger than distance...\\\"\\n\\n[Screen transitions to a montage of diverse people around the globe, all interacting and sharing moments on their devices.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome to ConnectUs.\\\"\\n\\n[A logo of ConnectUs fades in on the screen with a catchy slogan beneath it: \\\"Your world, closer.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"ConnectUs is more than a social network, it's a global community.\\\"\\n\\n[The video shows users exploring different features of the social network like posting pictures, sharing statuses, joining groups and video calling.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Share your moments, express your thoughts, follow your passions, make new friends, and connect with old ones.\\\"\\n\\n[The video shows a user finding an old friend and starting a chat, their faces lighting up with joy.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"With our advanced security features, your privacy is our top priority.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen shows a lock symbol and a shield, signifying safety and security.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And with our innovative technology, you can reach out in more ways than ever before.\\\"\\n\\n[