. Contact [Your Therapy Business Name] today. Let's journey towards a better you, together.\\\"\\n\\n[Closing shot: Text on screen - \\\"You're not alone. We're here to help.\\\"]\\n\\n[End of Advert: Fade out with soft, calming music]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 456}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720827178, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kK309PoDBsqiGY0xKL3NKGGC3uKr\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat, energetic music playing]\\n\\n[Opening shot: A close up of a chilled beer can, slowly rotating while beads of condensation trickle down its side.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"The world is full of ordinary. But you, my friend, you're not ordinary. You're extraordinary.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a group of friends laughing, having a great time around a bonfire on a beach.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"And your beer should be too. Introducing our premium crafted beer.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions to a brewery, showing the process of brewing, highlighting the authenticity and craftsmanship.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Handcrafted with the finest ingredients. Brewed with time, love, and precision to give you an unforgettable taste.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions back to the beach. A hand reaches into a cooler, pulling out a can of our beer. The sound of the can opening is clear, crisp.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"A beer that stands out, just like you.\\\"\\n\\n[The friends raise their cans for a toast, the fire crackling in the background.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"A beer that pairs perfectly with good friends, great stories, and even better memories.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close up of the beer can with the logo prominently displayed.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Because you're not here to blend in. You're here to stand out.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the logo and tagline fading in. The tagline reads: \\\"Stand Out. Be Extraordinary. Drink [Name of the beer]\\\"