.\\\"\\n\\n[Show a slow-motion shot of the powder being mixed with water]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\n\\\"ProFitMax is packed with high-quality whey protein, essential amino acids, and vital nutrients. It provides the perfect blend to help you build lean muscle, recover faster, and stay in peak form.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a man drinking the protein shake and then lifting weights, showing improvement]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"Whether you're a professional athlete or a fitness enthusiast, ProFitMax is the perfect workout companion.\\\"\\n\\n[Show before and after photos of users]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"No more skipping meals. No more unhealthy snacking. Just one scoop of ProFitMax and you're fueled for the day.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a woman adding the protein powder to her smoothie bowl]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"And the best part? It\\u2019s not just for shakes. You can mix it with your oatmeal, blend it in your smoothie, or bake it into your pancakes for that extra protein punch.\\\"\\n\\n[Show the tub of ProFitMax with different flavors]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"ProFitMax comes in a variety of delicious flavors that will make your taste buds sing. Chocolate Fudge, Vanilla Cr\\u00e8me, Strawberry Delight, and many more.\\\"\\n\\n[Show the ProFitMax logo and tagline]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"ProFitMax. Power up your performance.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to an end screen with the product, website, and social media handles]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"Order now at ProFitMax.com or find us at your local health store. Follow us on Instagram and Facebook for more fitness tips and inspiration.\\\"\\n\\n[Upbeat music fades out]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover):\\n\\\"ProFitMax \\u2013 Unleash your potential!\\\"\\n\\n[End of the advert]\\n\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 519}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720827747, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kKCBJHfOndlpRRKtCjyuLCF1mpXS\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script 