anding performance, even in the most challenging terrains.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene changes: The car is shown parking itself in a tight spot]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our advanced safety systems ensure that you and your loved ones are protected, always.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene changes: The car is seen driving along a beautiful coastal road at sunset]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Experience the freedom of the open road, the thrill of the journey, the joy of the destination.\\\"\\n\\n[Final Scene: The car model and logo appears on screen]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"The all-new (Car Model)... Engineered to exhilarate. Discover the difference today.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black with the car company\\u2019s logo, their tagline, and website]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"(Car Company's Tagline). Visit (Website) to book a test drive today.\\\" \\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 365}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720827801, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kKD3WnFoQlmmvIH8YkrWn5vP0aMh\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a diy store\", \"response\": \"[Background music playing: Upbeat, lively, and inspiring tune]\\n\\n[Open with a wide shot of a sprawling DIY store, filled with aisles of tools, paints, fixtures, gardening supplies, and more]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Welcome to Build It Big, your ultimate DIY haven!\\\" \\n\\n[Cut to a customer walking into the store, their face lighting up as they scan the vast selection]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"We understand that every project is personal. That\\u2019s why at Build It Big, we have everything you need to make your dream a reality.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a sequence of shots showcasing different departments: wood, paint, hardware, power tools, plumbing, electrical, kitchen, garden, etc.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Whether you're a seasoned builder, a gardening enthusiast or just a weekend warrior, we've got you covered. From power tools to paint, plants to plumbing, and every