aming.\\\"\\n\\n[Background music fades out. Screen fades to black with the console's logo and website URL.]\\n\\nEnd of Advert.\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 490}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720828554, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kKPCRtl3GL4ZOtX4xhjehmuXyKMt\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a social network\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\n[Scene: A montage of people from different walks of life, all using their devices]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"In this fast-paced world, staying connected has never been more important.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a young woman video calling her family]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Introducing 'ConnectUs' \\u2013 the social network that brings your world closer.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a group of friends sharing photos and laughing]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Share your life\\u2019s best moments, memories and milestones with friends and family...\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a man using the app for a business meeting]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Or use it to collaborate with colleagues and grow your professional network.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to various clips of people using features of the app]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"With ConnectUs, you can share photos, post updates, join groups of interest, and even host virtual events.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a user scrolling through a news feed]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Stay informed with tailored news feeds based on your interests.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a user finding an old friend]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Rekindle old friendships or make new ones.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of the app logo on a device]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"ConnectUs - it's not just a social network, it's your social network.\\\"\\n\\n[End scene with the logo of ConnectUs]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Download ConnectUs today and start connecting on a whole new level. Available on iOS and Android.\\\"\\n\\n[End scene with the tagline]\\n\\nText on Screen: \\\"ConnectUs \\u2013 Your World. Closer.\\\"\\