at.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A close-up of a sign reading: \\\"Sizes XXS to XXXL\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (Voice-over): \\\"We believe style has no size. That's why we cater to all sizes \\u2013 from XXS to XXXL.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A quick montage of customers at the checkout, leaving with shopping bags, looking satisfied]\\n\\nNarrator (Voice-over): \\\"At Style Central, we offer the latest trends at affordable prices, making it easy for everyone to enjoy the best in fashion.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A close-up shot of a smiling shop assistant helping a customer]\\n\\nNarrator (Voice-over): \\\"Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always on hand to help you find your perfect fit.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A shot of the shop\\u2019s exterior, with a sign that reads: \\\"Style Central\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (Voice-over): \\\"So, why wait? Step into Style Central today.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The screen fades to black, with the shop's logo and website displayed]\\n\\nNarrator (Voice-over): \\\"Style Central \\u2013 Express Yourself.\\\"\\n\\n[End with upbeat jingle] \\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 434}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720828788, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kKSyOXe6lgqySo7hzCpwZ3bYqA57\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting furniture polish\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A dull, dusty wooden table. A gloomy atmosphere.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Tired of your wooden furniture looking dull and lifeless? \\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of a woman's face, looking frustrated as she wipes the table with a plain cloth, but the dust remains.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Fed up with all the dust and grime that refuses to budge?\\\"\\n\\n[Suddenly, the room brightens, and upbeat music starts to play.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Then you need our Premium Furniture Polish!\\\"\\n\\n[Switch to a shot of a hand holding the product, with the name clearly visible. The hand sprays the polish on the table.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \