s brand new]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our unique formula not only cleans but also protects your furniture, leaving it looking shiny and new.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close-ups of the shiny table and the furniture polish bottle]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"It's perfect for all types of wooden furniture.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The woman applying the polish on other wooden furniture like chairs, cabinets]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"It's not only about cleaning, it's about preserving!\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The woman looks happy with the result]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Get your furniture to shine like it deserves with our premium furniture polish.\\\"\\n\\n[Closing Scene: The bottle of furniture polish is shown with a tagline and contact details]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Bring life back to your furniture. Buy our furniture polish today!\\\"\\n\\n[End of the Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 350}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720829280, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kKauWnTDDyg8Sec20ZmMzZDKKUvl\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a washing machine\", \"response\": \"[Background music playing softly]\\n\\n[Opening scene: A woman is seen struggling with a mountain of laundry]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Is laundry day becoming more of a chore than it needs to be?\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions to a sparkling new washing machine]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing our latest innovation, the UltraClean 3000 washing machine. Designed to make your life easier.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows a close-up of the washing machine\\u2019s sleek design, highlighting its features]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Its large 10 kg drum capacity means more clothes washed in one go, saving you time and energy.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene changes to show the washing machine's digital display]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"With a simple touch control panel and an array of pre-set programs, you can customize every wash to suit your needs. From heav