d contact information.]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Visit our website or call us now to get yours. Change the way you work, forever.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 434}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720831129, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kL4jh5ZWKSns3rCo2aRDPn4fPEjR\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A peaceful, serene nursery with a crib, toys, and a changing station. Cut to a glowing, new mother cradling a sleeping baby.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"Every mother knows, a happy baby makes a happy home.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a pile of different brands of nappies.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"But with so many choices, how do you know which nappy is the right one for your baby?\\\"\\n\\n[Transition to a shot of our brand of nappies.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"Introducing our brand of nappies. The number one choice for moms who want only the best for their little ones.\\\"\\n\\n[Show close-ups of the nappy's features - the soft, absorbent material, the secure, flexible waistband.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"Crafted from super soft, breathable materials, our nappies ensure maximum comfort for your baby. With ultra-absorbent cores, they provide unparalleled leakage protection for up to 12 hours.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the mother from earlier, effortlessly changing her baby's nappy.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"Our flexible waistband and stretchy sides make for an easy, snug fit, so your baby can move freely and comfortably.\\\"\\n\\n[Show a split-screen comparison of a baby wearing another brand of nappies (looking uncomfortable and crying) and a baby wearing our brand of nappies (happy and playing).]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"No more discomfort, no more tears. Just pure comfort and joy for your little one.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the nappy packaging with the brand logo.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voice-over): \\\"Choose the best for your