y, ConnectUs keeps you closer to the people who matter most.\\\"\\n\\n(Video visual of the app features - personalized feed, groups, chat, video calls, and more.)\\n\\nNarrator (Voice Over): \\\"Experience a variety of features tailored for your needs. From personalized feeds and group chats to live streaming and video calls, ConnectUs makes your online experience more engaging and interactive.\\\"\\n\\n(Video visual of a person downloading and installing the ConnectUs app.)\\n\\nNarrator (Voice Over): \\\"Join the ConnectUs community today. Download the app now and start connecting on a deeper level.\\\"\\n\\n(Video ends with the ConnectUs logo and tagline)\\n\\nNarrator (Voice Over): \\\"ConnectUs - Connect, Share, Discover.\\\"\\n\\n[Background Music Ends]\\n\\nScreen Text: \\\"Download Now on App Store & Google Play Store.\\\"\\n\\nVoice Over (CTA): \\\"Download ConnectUs today and start your journey of connection. ConnectUs - Your world, connected.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 460}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720831677, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kLDZpteY1HVl01sPmEoSg0cv3tVF\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a yoga class\", \"response\": \"[Soft instrumental music playing]\\n\\n[Visual: A sun rising over a peaceful landscape]\\n\\nNarrator: (Voiceover) \\\"As the sun rises and the world awakens, where will you be?\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Aerial view of a city with bustling traffic]\\n\\nNarrator: (Voiceover) \\\"Caught in the hustle and bustle of the daily grind?\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Switch to a serene yoga studio]\\n\\nNarrator: (Voiceover) \\\"Or finding your balance and inner peace?\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: A yoga instructor in a sun-filled room, demonstrating a pose]\\n\\nNarrator: (Voiceover) \\\"Welcome to our Yoga Class.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: People of all ages and fitness levels practicing yoga]\\n\\nNarrator: (Voiceover) \\\"A place for everyone, regardless of age or fitness level, to find t