ding out.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 395}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720831785, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kLFJsUdAiR7hqwoFF7e7KJwhJfEB\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weight loss programme\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Enthusiastically) Are you tired of endless diets? Exhausted by strenuous workouts? Not seeing the results you want? We have the perfect solution for you!\\n\\n[Cut to an image of a happy, energetic person]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Excitedly) Introducing our revolutionary weight loss programme! \\n\\n[Cut to before-and-after images of people who have successfully lost weight]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Inspiringly) Real people, real results! Our scientifically proven methods are designed to help you shed those stubborn pounds and keep them off!\\n\\n[Cut to clips of a diverse group of people working out, enjoying healthy meals, consulting with nutritionists and trainers]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Passionately) Our comprehensive programme includes personalised meal plans, one-on-one fitness coaching, and 24/7 support to keep you motivated and on track.\\n\\n[Cut to a clip of a digital application showing workout routines and meal plan]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Innovatively) Plus, with our state-of-the-art app, you can track your progress, access workouts, and get delicious, healthy recipes right at your fingertips.\\n\\n[Cut to testimonials from satisfied customers]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Trustworthily) But don't just take our word for it, listen to our satisfied customers who have transformed their bodies and lives!\\n\\nCUSTOMER 1: (Happily) This programme changed my life. I've lost 30 pounds and I've never felt better!\\n\\nCUSTOMER 2: (Excitedly) I finally found something that works for me! This programme is a game-changer.\\n\\n[Cut back to VOICEOVER]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Warmly) It\\u2019s time to start your transformation journey. Join our weight loss programme today and let's make your dream body