\": 366}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720832620, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kLSmPd6uduJSEmEgpin7oRFhFwVO\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[Open with a shot of a shimmering beach at sunset. Gentle waves are rolling onto the shore. The sound of laughter and the strumming of a guitar can be heard in the distance.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"You know those moments that make life worth living?\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a group of friends around a bonfire, laughing and enjoying the evening. A cooler is opened, revealing a row of glistening beer bottles.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Those moments of pure joy, shared with friends...\\\"\\n\\n[A hand reaches into the cooler, pulling out a bottle. The cap is popped off with a satisfying sound.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Those are the moments we live for. And they\\u2019re even better with our beer.\\\"\\n\\n[The beer is poured into a glass, the golden liquid forming a frothy head.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Introducing [Beer Brand]. Crafted to perfection. Brewed for the best of times.\\\"\\n\\n[The group raises their glasses in a toast, the firelight flickering off the beer bottles.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Brewed with passion. Brewed for you.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the beer bottle, condensation trickling down its side. The label is clearly visible.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"[Beer Brand]. For the moments that matter.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades, leaving just the beer logo and tagline: \\\"[Beer Brand]. Live the Moment.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"[Beer Brand]. Live the Moment.\\\"\\n\\n[End with the sound of glasses clinking together and laughter.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Please drink responsibly.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Available at your local retailer.\\\"\\n\\n[Fade out.]\\n\\nEnd of advert.\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 350}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720832635, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kLT1DCOz12dzkoMsOnc0dL1AMjyw\", \"prompt\": \"Write a scrip