leek design and state-of-the-art features.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"Introducing the all-new HyperXtreme gaming console - where power meets precision.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen transitions to high-definition game footage, showcasing stunning graphics, realistic characters, and immersive environments.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"Experience gaming like never before with our unrivaled processing power and jaw-dropping graphics.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a young person sitting on a couch, gripping a controller, their eyes wide with excitement.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"HyperXtreme takes you beyond just playing. It transports you into a world where YOU are the hero, the villain, the champion.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen transitions to the console's user-friendly interface, showing easy navigation through games, apps, and settings.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"With our intuitive interface, your favorite games, movies, and music are only a click away.\\\"\\n\\n[Shift to a scene showing the online multiplayer mode, players from different parts of the world competing in a virtual arena.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"Join our expansive online community and compete with players from around the globe.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene showing the console's unique VR capability.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"Step into the future with our groundbreaking virtual reality feature, creating an immersive gaming experience like no other.\\\"\\n\\n[Return to a close-up of the gaming console. The console's logo, HyperXtreme, glows brightly against the dark background.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"HyperXtreme - where reality ends, and the game begins.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black, with the words 'Available Now' and the brand's website appearing.]\\n\\nVoice-over (V.O): \\\"Get your HyperXtreme gaming console today. Visit our website or your nearest retailer. Power your play with HyperXtreme.\\\"\\n\\n[End with the brand's logo and tagline.]\\n\\nV.O: \\\"HyperXtreme - Unleash the game.\\\"\\n\\n[Advert ends with upbeat music fading out.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tok